## SECTION=image

config IMAGE_XXRI_FIRMWARE_AMD_TCZ
	tristate
	prompt "Generate xxri-firmware-amd.tcz"
	help
	  Firmware for AMD GPUs up to GCN 3: radeon Southern/Sea Islands (HD
	  7000, R7/R9 200/300) and amdgpu Tonga, Fiji, Topaz, Carrizo, Stoney
	  (loaded at boot, before the udev trigger that loads the KMS drivers).
